; Var(20) - MAX Mode Timer
; Var(21) - Super Cancel Flag
; Var(22) - MAX Cancel Flag
; Var(23) - Super Finish Type (3000 = Crescent Stiletto Strike; 3100 = Poison Kiss; 3200 = High Heel Assault)
