victory9 = "I need fighters who are made of stronger stuff. My wrestling league has no openings for you."
victory10 = "I'm stronger and more beautiful than you. We didn't need to fight to figure that out though."
victory11 = "Yeah...now that's how you put on a show! Can you feel the excitement in the air?"
victory12 = "You're not half bad. Too bad there weren't more people watching that great fight."
victory13 = "Learn to put your money where your mouth is!"
victory14 = "I thought you were gonna be tougher than that! Color me disappointed."
victory15 = "You got guts, I'll give you that. That's all you got though."
victory16 = "Not bad for a sideshow. As a fighter, you're completely terrible though."
